msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:5
#: fad1e6959c7449ea9e1ba95d9bcdf9c8
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:7
#: 3b58d64ccb4449afb5e5e2404c6784ee
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:9
#: d1f600809e3f446fbf42a335b13bebdc
msgid ""
"按倍率、目标胞长或原子数上限扩胞，为缺陷/表面/磁性操作提供足够空间。三种扩胞"
"策略三选一：固定倍率（`scale`）、目标胞长（`cell`）、原子数上限"
"（`max_atoms`）。可锁定特定轴向不扩胞——适合 slab 等需要维持法向层间距的场景。"
msgstr ""
"Expand a structure by fixed replication, target cell lengths, or an atom-"
"count limit so downstream defect, surface, and magnetic operations have "
"enough space. Choose one strategy: `scale`, `cell`, or `max_atoms`. "
"Individual axes can be locked, which is useful for preserving the normal "
"direction of a slab."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:11
#: 0ed857e968174e49997e6f8d32745b26
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:13
#: af5d9b0705c54bb49051de215c511a19
msgid ""
"\\mathbf{T}=\\mathrm{diag}(n_a,n_b,n_c),\\quad \\mathbf{C}'=\\mathbf{C}"
"\\mathbf{T},\\quad N'=N\\cdot n_a n_b n_c"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:15
#: 4ec7226ae183423c9ddd743bc4654fa1
msgid ""
"$n_a,n_b,n_c$ 是三个方向的正整数重复数。目标胞长模式把每个 $n_i$ 取到足以达到"
"目标 长度的最小整数；原子数上限模式在 $N'$ 不超过预算的前提下选择重复数。锁定"
"轴固定对应 $n_i=1$。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:19
#: 58d964a0c4f94e789f6d37e0c9d51b8f
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:21
#: d5f066135af84d40ab7565d8ffbc2e68
msgid ""
"场景：模型在小胞上训练后跑空位计算，周期镜像干扰导致空位形成能偏高 0.5 eV"
msgstr "Scenario: Periodic images raise the vacancy formation energy by 0.5 eV"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:23
#: 69b0d495530448c0a8654ab9c1e299b9
msgid ""
"你在 bcc Fe 上用 2x2x2 超胞（16 原子）训练了一个 NEP 模型。拿这个模型算单空位"
"形成能，结果比 DFT 高了 0.5 eV。诊断发现：2x2x2 太小的胞里，空位和它的周期镜"
"像之间距离只有约 5 Å，空位-空位镜像相互作用不可忽略，模型学到的实际上是\"带镜"
"像相互作用的空位\"而非孤立空位。"
msgstr ""
"A bcc Fe NEP is trained on 2x2x2 cells with 16 atoms and overestimates a "
"single-vacancy formation energy by 0.5 eV. The vacancy is only about 5 Å "
"from its periodic images, so the training environment represents interacting "
"vacancy images rather than an isolated defect."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:25
#: 073a410c261b452586b88cb68f815ee5
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 缺陷计算的黄金法则是\"超胞要大到使缺陷-缺陷镜像相互作用可忽略"
"\"。2x2x2 = 16 原子的胞对空位来说太小。解法是在训练集里用更大的超胞（至少 "
"3x3x3 = 54 原子或 4x4x4 = 128 原子）做空位计算，这样模型至少见过大胞里的空位"
"环境。同时，下游做空位操作时也需要大胞作为母结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Defect cells must be large enough that interactions between "
"periodic defect images are negligible for the target accuracy. Add vacancy "
"labels in larger cells, for example 3x3x3 or 4x4x4, and use such cells as "
"parents for downstream defect generation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:27
#: 83a5d6cce1ac43ce84aba33534e49db0
msgid "**输入：** 一个 bcc Fe 原胞（2 原子）"
msgstr "**Input:** A two-atom bcc Fe primitive cell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:29
#: 32b2ae82c1a14ad48cf0c1570c922027
msgid "**目标：** 扩到 4x4x4 超胞（128 原子），为后续空位缺陷生成提供母结构"
msgstr "**Objective:** Build a 4x4x4, 128-atom parent for vacancy generation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:31
#: 706bad32d74841edaf399ebbbac621a1
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:32
#: 407935ad49bc4b7d98943555127ff8e6
msgid "mode = `scale`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:33
#: 31b378901793480d964f5baecf705ab3
msgid "`超胞倍率`（`super_scale`） = `[4, 4, 4]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:35
#: 64f4b2ae2f28467a8c7805f340e95428
msgid "**输出：** 1 个 4x4x4 超胞结构，128 原子"
msgstr "**Output:** One 4x4x4 supercell with 128 atoms."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:37
#: 5df682cab1dc4a7db5f8433d9b65b129
msgid "**怎么验证结果合理：**"
msgstr "**How to verify the result:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:38
#: 3e5b463e2c9c4955b6365999e273f7e4
msgid "检查原子数：原胞 2 原子 * 4 * 4 * 4 = 128，核对输出"
msgstr "Check atom count: 2 × 4 × 4 × 4 = 128."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:39
#: 0047b1ca00024d5abbebfa020c19c4c5
msgid "检查晶格矢量：每个方向拉长 4 倍，体积增大 64 倍"
msgstr ""
"Check lattice vectors: each is four times longer and volume is 64 times "
"larger."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:40
#: 3596ec8806ad4f68bc563d4777c3132f
msgid ""
"如果空位形成能仍偏高，继续增大到 5x5x5 = 250 原子，直到 DFT 和 NEP 的形成能收"
"敛"
msgstr ""
"If the vacancy formation energy remains size dependent, repeat at larger "
"cells until the chosen DFT and NEP comparisons are converged."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:41
#: ccdcca3567244671b3584b32ccd685c3
msgid "如果超胞太大计算不起，用 `最大原子数`（`max_atoms`）模式设置预算上限"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:43
#: 99f4b852a2ac4274a0c8f84ef920a60f
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:45
#: 7178e7e4927b42f7953544de298b036c
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:46
#: 228f9d030dbb42c3b6f2f77a763e060a
msgid "下游要做缺陷（空位、间隙）、表面（slab）、磁性操作，需要超胞作为母结构"
msgstr ""
"Downstream vacancies, interstitials, surfaces, or magnetic patterns need a "
"larger parent cell"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:47
#: e6f7bea153f9417a95ecc0b4a8d27ae7
msgid "当前训练集胞太小，周期镜像干扰不可忽略"
msgstr "Periodic-image interactions are not negligible in current cells"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:48
#: 65699d2fcbb24b618ac12b699c1a10c5
msgid "需要扩胞以使 defect-defect 距离 > 10 Å"
msgstr "A specified minimum defect-image separation is required"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:50
#: 80005d09e5ab4a4e977d3a4c86f813ab
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:51
#: ce3a5ae7c1e24eb5b4fcf5c9fb1ff51e
msgid ""
"下游任务是体相性质（弹性常数、声子），原胞/小胞就够 —— 扩胞只会白增计算量"
msgstr ""
"The task is a bulk property already converged in the primitive or small cell"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:52
#: 2d383248c84149ba88249917f8346ab0
msgid ""
"计算预算严重受限，扩胞后 DFT 跑不动 —— 这种情况下维持小胞，接受周期镜像有残留"
"误差"
msgstr ""
"The DFT budget cannot support the expanded cell and the remaining finite-"
"size error is explicitly accepted"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:53
#: 9417c60cdde34909bb6ae7d5dbd30a04
msgid ""
"需要的是带应变的晶格变化而非单纯的重复复制 —— 用 `Lattice Strain` 或 `Cell "
"Scaling`"
msgstr ""
"Cell deformation rather than replication is needed; use `Lattice Strain` or "
"`Lattice Perturb`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:55
#: 66b4446e5c4e4426952f3abd5631ca46
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:57
#: 3366a6a2f7934827b49f95b143752cf2
msgid "扩胞策略"
msgstr "Expansion strategy"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:59
#: 88e04fd6c188438bb7b146ff3229a13c
msgid "扩胞方式（behavior_type）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:61
#: e52b0ea77ff04da38c98d4f79e0eb273
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0。控制输出哪些超胞。`0` = 单输出：scale 模式输出刚好那个倍数；"
"cell 模式输出最大或最小倍数的超胞；max_atoms 模式输出原子数最大的那个。`1` = "
"枚举：从 1x1x1 到目标倍数，所有中间组合都输出——适合想一次生成多个不同大小的超"
"胞。`2` = 最小满足：cell 模式用 ceil 取整（至少达到目标长度），max_atoms 模式"
"同理——适合\"至少多大才够\"的场景。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. Selects outputs. `0` returns one requested/selected "
"cell; `1` enumerates intermediate replication combinations from 1x1x1 "
"through the target; `2` uses the smallest replication that meets a target, "
"including ceiling behavior for target lengths. Estimate enumeration size "
"before using mode 1."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:63
#: 6dc75d759c6a428ea8a9d3e8cce023db
msgid "模式（mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:65
#: d5c21c20c1c44fb18baa3011cac77c87
msgid ""
"`SuperCellMode`，默认 `'scale'`。`\"scale\"` 按 `超胞倍率`（`super_scale`）里"
"写死的倍数扩——你最清楚自己要多大时用这个。`\"cell\"` 按 `目标晶胞长度`"
"（`target_cell`）里的目标胞长（单位 Å）自动算倍数，每个方向的倍数 = floor 或 "
"ceil（目标长度/原始长度），取决于 `扩胞方式`（`behavior_type`）——想让胞长达到"
"特定数值（比如所有方向大于等于 20 Å）时用这个。`\"max_atoms\"` 按原子数上限枚"
"举所有可能的倍数组合，输出所有不超过上限的超胞——预算受限时找最大可用超胞用这"
"个。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:67
#: 7577dc60d71a4a2283a5251d730e72eb
msgid "超胞倍率（super_scale）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:69
#: 9fa9b9184e75456dbb56a35bf43e002d
msgid ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `(3, 3, 3)`。仅 scale 模式生效。a/b/c 方向各复制"
"几倍，最小 1（不复制），典型值 2~4。注意 3x3x3 = 27 倍原子数，提前心算一下总"
"原子数别超预算。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`, default `(3, 3, 3)`; scale only. Replication along "
"a, b, and c, with minimum 1. Total atom count is multiplied by their product."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:71
#: ee58a76f8dd84bc48c7d39eb02d868a9
msgid "目标晶胞长度（target_cell）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:73
#: 40d35d52782f49b38cff4c489e69c1fb
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(20.0, 20.0, 20.0)`。仅 cell 模式生效。各"
"方向的目标胞长，单位 Å。比如原胞 a 长度 = 5 Å 时，target=20 会算出倍数 4（或 "
"5，取决于 behavior_type 是 floor 还是 ceil）。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(20.0, 20.0, 20.0)` Å; cell only. "
"Target lengths by axis. Replication is derived from target/original length "
"and the selected floor/ceiling behavior."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:75
#: a63e5b5e9034453ba707d012e60d93b2
msgid "最大原子数（max_atoms）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:77
#: 44ac67cca963428d98d3806f784439a6
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 100。仅 max_atoms 模式生效。超胞总原子数上限，实际输出可能包含多"
"个不超过此上限的不同倍数超胞。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `100`; max-atoms only. Upper bound on total atoms. "
"Enumeration behavior may emit several replication combinations below it."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:79
#: 587a739c1c3248289eb96935ecc6f90f
msgid "轴向锁定"
msgstr "Axis locking"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:81
#: af9d00af51124e80852850c4309be499
msgid "固定轴选择（fixed_axis_flags）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:83
#: 683e52ba015742b1af20816fbfb05faf
msgid ""
"`tuple[bool, bool, bool]`，默认 `(false, false, false)`。锁定 a/b/c 方向的扩"
"胞倍数。最适合 slab 场景：把法向（通常 c 轴）锁住不扩，只扩面内两个方向。被锁"
"住的轴用 `固定轴倍率`（`fixed_axis_scale`）里对应的倍数，不被锁住的轴正常扩。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:85
#: 01d4a96d53454e5cb9ac0d8b6f19f0ad
msgid "固定轴倍率（fixed_axis_scale）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:87
#: 0c797e7631ef4553957669f24a4d497a
msgid ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `(1, 1, 1)`。仅对 `固定轴选择`"
"（`fixed_axis_flags`）中对应位置为 true 的轴生效。通常设为 1（不扩胞），但如"
"果你需要一个方向固定扩 2 倍、另一个方向自由扩，也可以设成其他值。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:89
#: d9dbe5eab3bd4d48a540e11aefd80f59
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:91
#: 01711b5ccfaa4f01a94672905ba88591
msgid "快速扩胞（固定 3x3x3，单输出）"
msgstr "Direct 3x3x3 expansion (one output)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:92
#: 7767192b6d7a4066bdf107706f4e39ee
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"SuperCellCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"mode\": \"scale\",\n"
"  \"behavior_type\": 0,\n"
"  \"super_scale\": [3, 3, 3],\n"
"  \"target_cell\": [20, 20, 20],\n"
"  \"max_atoms\": 100,\n"
"  \"fixed_axis_flags\": [false, false, false],\n"
"  \"fixed_axis_scale\": [1, 1, 1]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:106
#: bb3d50aa010546cfaf2bc3ea6b0103b8
msgid "Slab 扩胞（面内扩到 20 Å，法向锁 1x，枚举所有组合）"
msgstr ""
"Slab expansion (20 Å in plane, normal locked at 1x, enumerate combinations)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:107
#: 367187416edf43ffb774daff4c87b43c
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"SuperCellCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"mode\": \"cell\",\n"
"  \"behavior_type\": 1,\n"
"  \"super_scale\": [3, 3, 3],\n"
"  \"target_cell\": [20, 20, 20],\n"
"  \"max_atoms\": 100,\n"
"  \"fixed_axis_flags\": [false, false, true],\n"
"  \"fixed_axis_scale\": [1, 1, 1]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:121
#: 4d95a2e47c034b26868414fe09dd454c
msgid "预算限制下的最大超胞（≤ 300 原子，取最大）"
msgstr "Largest supercell under a 300-atom budget"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:122
