msgid ""
"`Super Cell` → `FPS Filter`：枚举模式产生大量超胞时，用 FPS 去重（相同大小的"
"超胞只有 1 个有用）"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` -> `FPS Filter`: reduce redundant outputs from an intentionally "
"broad enumeration"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:143
#: 251336e8e1e74f79887e9a73867b116c
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:145
#: 6be788dc6ec743a3b946c56567bcee76
msgid ""
"**输出只有 1x1x1（等于没扩胞）。** 如果原胞自身已经满足目标——例如原胞 3 Å、"
"target_cell=20、behavior_type=0 时倍数=6，但原胞 a 长度已经 25 Å —— 倍数被截"
"断为 1。检查 target_cell 是否设得比原胞还小。或者在 max_atoms 模式下，原胞原"
"子数已超上限，只输出原胞。"
msgstr ""
"**Only 1x1x1 is returned.** The input may already meet `target_cell`, or its "
"atom count may already exceed `max_atoms`. Compare target lengths and budget "
"with the input cell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:147
#: b26ab170dec84bfd9f41d0729b4aa6a0
msgid ""
"**Slab 面内方向扩胞不均匀。** `固定轴选择`（`fixed_axis_flags`）只锁了法向，"
"面内两个方向各走各的倍数。如果面内需要正方形胞，确保 target_cell 的 a/b 目标"
"值一致，或者用 scale 模式手动统一倍数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:149
#: 96899b193f214b37b4d88bb4cfd6904d
msgid ""
"**原子数暴增超出计算预算。** 4x4x4 = 64 倍原子数。先心算：倍数 = (na*nb*nc)，"
"原子数 = 原胞原子数 * 倍数。谨慎选择 behavior_type=1（枚举模式），因为从 "
"1x1x1 到目标倍数会产生多个不同大小的超胞。"
msgstr ""
"**Atom count exceeds the budget.** Compute `n_input × na × nb × nc` first. "
"Enumeration mode also emits multiple sizes, not just the largest."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:151
#: 73add1f21647432582ef9b79a08baa3c
msgid ""
"**枚举模式产生过多超胞。** behavior_type=1 + max_atoms=500 + 原胞=2 原子 → 所"
"有 ≤250 倍原子数的组合都会被输出。如果不需要所有中间大小，改用 "
"behavior_type=0 只取最大。"
msgstr ""
"**Enumeration produces too many cells.** Mode 1 emits all allowed "
"intermediate combinations. Use behavior 0 when only the largest selected "
"cell is needed."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:153
#: a614d3d65b1a4effa81e8831ceddebe4
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:155
#: 8ff81603736c4dc69dd17a992f11c36d
msgid "`SC({na}x{nb}x{nc})` —— 如 `SC(4x4x4)`。"
msgstr "`SC({na}x{nb}x{nc})`, for example `SC(4x4x4)`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:157
#: 457d92217eca48deb1a3dc8fed6ecba0
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:159
#: 120252c292ce4de0bf04ea9d002c30c6
msgid "无随机性。同参数同输入 → 严格一致输出。"
msgstr ""
"Deterministic: identical inputs and parameters produce identical outputs."

#~ msgid "超胞生成（Super Cell）"
#~ msgstr "Super Cell"

#~ msgid "如果超胞太大计算不起，用 `max_atoms` 模式设置预算上限"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If larger cells exceed the labeling budget, use `max_atoms` to impose a "
#~ "hard size limit."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`SuperCellMode`，默认 `'scale'`。`\"scale\"` 按 `super_scale` 里写死的倍数"
#~ "扩——你最清楚自己要多大时用这个。`\"cell\"` 按 `target_cell` 里的目标胞长"
#~ "（单位 Å）自动算倍数，每个方向的倍数 = floor 或 ceil（目标长度/原始长"
#~ "度），取决于 `behavior_type`——想让胞长达到特定数值（比如所有方向大于等于 "
#~ "20 Å）时用这个。`\"max_atoms\"` 按原子数上限枚举所有可能的倍数组合，输出所"
#~ "有不超过上限的超胞——预算受限时找最大可用超胞用这个。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`SuperCellMode`, default `'scale'`. `scale` uses explicit `super_scale`; "
#~ "`cell` derives per-axis replication from `target_cell` in Å using floor "
#~ "or ceiling according to `behavior_type`; `max_atoms` searches replication "
#~ "combinations under an atom-count cap. Use explicit scale when the "
#~ "required cell is known, target lengths for separation constraints, and "
#~ "max atoms for a budget-limited design."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[bool, bool, bool]`，默认 `(false, false, false)`。锁定 a/b/c 方向的"
#~ "扩胞倍数。最适合 slab 场景：把法向（通常 c 轴）锁住不扩，只扩面内两个方"
#~ "向。被锁住的轴用 `fixed_axis_scale` 里对应的倍数，不被锁住的轴正常扩。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[bool, bool, bool]`, default `(false, false, false)`. Lock "
#~ "replication along a, b, or c. For a slab, lock the normal and expand only "
#~ "in plane. Locked axes use `fixed_axis_scale`; others follow the selected "
#~ "strategy."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `(1, 1, 1)`。仅对 `fixed_axis_flags` 中对应位"
#~ "置为 true 的轴生效。通常设为 1（不扩胞），但如果你需要一个方向固定扩 2 "
#~ "倍、另一个方向自由扩，也可以设成其他值。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[int, int, int]`, default `(1, 1, 1)`. Replication values for axes "
#~ "enabled in `fixed_axis_flags`. Use 1 to preserve an axis or another fixed "
#~ "integer when required."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Slab 面内方向扩胞不均匀。** `fixed_axis_flags` 只锁了法向，面内两个方向"
#~ "各走各的倍数。如果面内需要正方形胞，确保 target_cell 的 a/b 目标值一致，或"
#~ "者用 scale 模式手动统一倍数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**A slab expands unevenly in plane.** Unlocked axes choose replication "
#~ "independently. Use equal a/b targets or explicit scale when a square in-"
#~ "plane cell is required."
